---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LinkButton from '../components/LinkButton';
import { Badge } from '../components/ui/badge';
import { Alert, AlertTitle, AlertDescription } from '../components/ui/alert';
import Faq from '../components/Faq';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
const posts = await getCollection('blog');
const featured = ['zcash-average-buying-price','zcash-tracker-alternatives','zcash-viewing-key-privacy'].map(id=>posts.find(p=>p.id===id)!);
const software = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'SoftwareApplication',name:site.name,applicationCategory:'FinanceApplication',operatingSystem:'macOS 14 or later; Apple Silicon',softwareVersion:site.version,description:'A native macOS development application for estimating the moving average acquisition price of selected Zcash wallet movements.',url:site.url,downloadUrl:`${site.url}/download/`,screenshot:`${site.url}/images/dashboard.webp`,author:{'@id':`${site.url}/#publisher`},offers:{'@type':'Offer',price:'0',priceCurrency:'USD'}};
---
<Base title="ZEC Buying Price — Zcash acquisition tracker for Mac" description="Estimate your average Zcash acquisition price on your Mac. View-only wallet scanning, historical USD prices, and manual overrides. Download the development DMG." schema={software}>
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A Zcash acquisition notebook</p><h1>Know what<br />your ZEC cost<span class="accent-dot">.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Trace your wallet movements. Find your average acquisition price. Keep the research on your Mac.</p><div class="hero-actions"><LinkButton href="/download/" /><LinkButton href="/methodology/" variant="outline" label="How it works" arrow="→" /></div></div>
    <figure class="hero-figure"><div class="image-label"><span>THE ACQUISITION LAB</span><span>macOS / {site.version}</span></div><img src="/images/dashboard.webp" srcset="/images/dashboard-mobile.webp 460w, /images/dashboard-small.webp 920w, /images/dashboard.webp 1840w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 94vw, 56vw" width="1840" height="1344" alt="ZEC Buying Price dashboard showing selected movements and an illustrative average acquisition price" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Native app capture. Synthetic transactions for illustration.</figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap compatibility"><span>Apple Silicon · macOS 14+</span><span>View-only access</span><span>Encrypted wallet storage</span><a href="/releases/">Development build · release details ↗</a></div>
  <section class="wrap section intro-section"><div><h2>Your balance tells one story.<br />Your acquisitions tell another.</h2><p>A wallet balance doesn’t tell you what you paid. ZEC Buying Price follows selected receipts and sends to estimate the acquisition value of what remains.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/zcash-average-buying-price/">Read the calculation →</a></div><div class="formula"><span class="formula-label">MOVING AVERAGE</span><div>Acquisition value<span class="fraction-line"></span>Remaining ZEC</div><p>Daily market prices are estimates.<br />Your actual records can replace them.</p></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section features"><h2>A small tool.<br />A traceable number.</h2><div class="feature-grid"><div class="feature-primary"><div><span class="feature-number">01 / REVIEW</span><h3>Choose the movements<br />that belong.</h3><p>Include or exclude confirmed receipts and sends. Your selected ledger stays distinct from your wallet balance.</p></div><img src="/images/manual-price.webp" srcset="/images/manual-price-small.webp 460w, /images/manual-price.webp 1100w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 84vw, 48vw" width="1100" height="813" loading="lazy" alt="Native price editor for entering an actual USD acquisition price per ZEC" /><a class="text-link" href="/setup/">See the setup guide →</a></div><div class="feature-stack"><div><span class="feature-number">02 / CORRECT</span><h3>Your price,<br />when you have it.</h3><p>Replace a daily CoinGecko observation with the actual USD price per ZEC from your purchase record.</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/wallet-receipts-vs-purchases/">Receipt or purchase? →</a></div><div><span class="feature-number">03 / INSPECT</span><h3>View the history.<br />Keep spending keys out.</h3><p>Import a Unified Full Viewing Key. Protect it with your Mac’s Secure Enclave and keep wallet history in encrypted local storage. The app does not sign transactions.</p><a class="text-link" href="/privacy/">Understand the data flow →</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section workflow"><h2>From viewing key to notebook.</h2><ol><li><span>01</span><h3>Connect</h3><p>Import a mainnet viewing key and set a birthday before your wallet’s first activity.</p></li><li><span>02</span><h3>Scan</h3><p>Fetch covered wallet history through your configured TLS lightwalletd endpoint.</p></li><li><span>03</span><h3>Review</h3><p>Check selections and prices. A complete average waits for complete inputs.</p></li></ol><Alert><AlertTitle>Available for development testing</AlertTitle><AlertDescription>The accounting core has automated tests. Complete wallet scanning and reorg behavior remain under verification. <a href="/releases/">Read the current limits</a> before relying on a result.</AlertDescription></Alert></section>
  <section class="wrap section notes"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Field notes</h2><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">All guides ↗</a></div><div class="note-list">{featured.map((post,i)=><a href={`/blog/${post.id}/`}><span class="note-index">0{i+1}</span><div><Badge variant="outline">{post.data.category}</Badge><h3>{post.data.title}</h3><p>{post.data.summary}</p></div><span class="note-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="wrap section faq-section"><h2>Before you download.</h2><Faq client:load /></section>
  <section class="wrap closing"><img src="/images/app-icon.webp" width="76" height="76" alt="" loading="lazy" /><div><h2>Open your acquisition notebook.</h2><p>Free development build for Apple Silicon Macs.</p></div><LinkButton href="/download/" /></section>
</Base>
